 "remarks": "Incredible opportunity to build or completely renovate in one of Westport's most desirable locations. Situated on a picturesque 1-acre lot, 53 Cross Highway offers a prime canvas for builders, investors or buyers looking to bring a custom project to life. The property currently features a 1950s-era home, providing an excellent footprint for an extensive transformation or a complete luxury rebuild. Highly sought-after placement within the prestigious Coleytown school district. Located just minutes from downtown shopping, dining, the Merritt Parkway, and Compo Beach, this property delivers the ideal setting for a high-end Fairfield County lifestyle. Bring your architect and your vision to maximize the potential of this exceptional lot. House sold As-Is.",
